focus a
a: 0xc set focus (previous none)
scene: 0xe set focus from a
scene: 0xe code 4 from scene
focus a again
a: 0xd kill focus (new a)
scene: 0xe kill focus from a
a: 0xc set focus (previous a)
scene: 0xe set focus from a
focus c
